\paragraph{Isolated Steps 1 and 3}
Performance metrics for Step 1 are shown in \Cref{tab:modelV_metrics}, for Step 3 (trained and tested on simulated $\Vec v_\text{sim}$) in~\Cref{tab:modelT_metrics}. The combination of quantitative (MAE of (22.3, 32.7)~m/y and 0.03~\degree C) and qualitative results through a visual assessment of~\Cref{fig:results_T} demonstrate a strong performance with heat plumes forming according to $k$.

