\title{  A Sharp and Robust Test for Selective Reporting }
\author{ Stefan Faridani\footnote{Georgia Institute of Technology. sfaridani6@gatech.edu. I thank Graham Elliott and Kaspar Wuthrich for helpful comments. I also thank Xianfang Xiong for excellent research assistance.}} 



