\section{Formative Study}
\label{sec:3}
To inform the design of an LLM-MA tool that supports interconnected character creation, we conducted semi-structured interviews with storywriters. We focused on identifying their approaches to interconnected character creation, the challenges they face during this process, and the strategies they use to overcome these difficulties. Insights from this study informed the three design goals for our tool. The study process was approved by our university’s Institutional Review Board (IRB No. concealed for anonymity).
