The rest of the paper is organized as following. Section \ref{sec:model} formally introduces the proposed method that is followed by theoretical properties discussed in Section \ref{sec:theory}. An efficient algorithm is outline in Section \ref{sec:algorithm}. We conduct extensive simulation studies in Section \ref{sec:simulation} and in-depth empirical analyses on equity premium prediction in Section \ref{sec:empirical}. 

