% J_i(t) = K_i(t,t)Q_i(t) - K_i(t,0)Q_i(0) - \int_0^t \partial_s K(t,s)Q_i(s)ds  & \leq K_i(t,t)(Q_i(t) - \inf_{s \leq t} Q_i(s)) \\
