in $\mD^b(\mN_k)$ together with its dual. They can be combined into a $(\Delta^1)^{\times 4}$ diagram because $\Map_{\mD^b(\mN_k)}\big(\mO[-1], \mO[3]\big)$ is 3-connected. As $\LL_{\pi_{\JS}}$ is the cocone of $\LL_{\pi_k}\to \mV\otimes \mV^*$, the obstruction theory $\FF_k$ is obtained by applying Proposition \ref{prop:sympullback} to the self-dual $\Delta^1\times \Delta^1$ diagram
