while the second one is determined by Lemma \ref{lem:cotangentofQ}. The expression looks the same for $I =I_{\Flag}$, except that there is no \BuOr{degree $-1$} term. The classical obstruction theory on $\mN_{I_k}$ is determined by the natural distinguished triangle
