in $\mD^b\big(\mN_{\un{d},\al}\big)$. 

The obstruction theory of Assumption \ref{ass:obsonflag} differs from $\wt{\FF}_{I}$ by an extra $\LL^{\vee}_{\pi_{I}}[2]$ term. One part of this assumption will be related to the additivity of the obstruction theories under the direct sum map 
