 I omit specifying the appropriate restriction of $\Theta_{\Flag}$.
 \item  For the projection $ \PP^{\sigma}_{\un{d},\al}:   \mN^{\sig}_{(1,\un{d}),\al}\to\mN^{\sigma}_{\un{d},\al}$, there should exist a homotopy commutative diagram 
