 Using Proposition \ref{prop:construct} with the above diagram gives rise to the obstruction theory $\FF^{\rig}_{\un{d},\al}$ on $\big(\mN^{\sig}_{\un{d},\al}\big)^{\rig}$ which is the rigidification of $\FF^{\sig}_{\un{d},\al}$ in the sense of \eqref{eq:rigidifyingEE}.  Due to Assumption \ref{ass:obsonflag}.a) and Example \ref{ex:mMvir}, there are virtual fundamental classes 
