In order to conduct and monitor system trials, we built a dashboard (Figure \ref{researcher-dashboard}) featuring live reaction statistics and timeline to provide a detailed analysis of student engagement with the application during an active session. We used this interface during all system trials to detect when a new student reaction is sent and observe the instructor’s response to the reactions.

